{"schemaVersion":1,"sourceRecord":{"schemaVersion":1,"recordId":"wikibooks-136702-r4518846","sourceId":"wikibooks-cookbook-cc-by-sa","sourceTitle":"Cookbook:Babi Panggang Sauce","sourcePageId":136702,"sourceRevision":"4518846","sourceRevisionTimestamp":"2025-06-21T17:18:35Z","sourceRevisionUser":"Kittycataclysm","sourceUrl":"https://en.wikibooks.org/w/index.php?title=Cookbook:Babi%20Panggang%20Sauce&oldid=4518846","retrievedAt":"2026-10-13T12:22:55.272Z","sourceCategories":["Category:Indonesian recipes","Category:Recipes","Category:Recipes for sauces and condiments","Category:Recipes using chicken broth and stock","Category:Recipes using garlic","Category:Recipes using sugar","Category:Recipes with metric units","Category:Recipes without cooking time","Category:Very Easy recipes"],"license":{"id":"wikibooks-cookbook-cc-by-sa-4.0","name":"Creative Commons Attribution-ShareAlike 4.0 International (CC BY-SA 4.0); Wikibooks text is generally dual-licensed with GFDL unless otherwise noted","evidenceUrl":"https://en.wikibooks.org/wiki/Wikibooks:Copyrights","policyStatus":"verified-license","pageExceptionStatus":"not-reviewed-per-page","attribution":"Attribute Wikibooks contributors by linking each version-specific source page. Indicate that structured fields are extracted and any translated or edited text is modified. Include CC BY-SA 4.0 notice/link and share adaptations under CC BY-SA 4.0 or later.","changeNoticeRequired":true,"shareAlikeRequired":true},"sourceSha256":"5dd969055baf63cd3f366c506976b9c6af68bc29697174784a80dd08cf137ca0","sourceWikitext":"{{recipesummary|\n| Category = Sauce recipes\n| Servings = 4\n| Difficulty = 1\n}}\n\n{{recipe}}\n\n'''Babi panggang''' is an Indonesian term applied to a variety of grilled pork dishes. In the Netherlands, babi panggang has become a fusion dish, typically prepared and served with a tomato-based sauce.\n\n==Ingredients==\n\n* 1 small [[Cookbook:onion|onion]]\n* 1 clove of [[Cookbook:garlic|garlic]]\n* 1 [[Cookbook:tablespoon|tablespoon]] of [[Cookbook:oil|oil]]\n* 1.5 deciliter (150 [[Cookbook:ML|ml]]) of [[Cookbook:Stock|chicken broth]]\n* 2 tablespoons of [[Cookbook:sugar|sugar]]\n* 1 tablespoon of [[Cookbook:sherry|sherry]]\n* 1 can of [[Cookbook:tomato|tomato]] [[Cookbook:purée|mash]]\n\n==Procedure==\n\n# Peel and [[Cookbook:Chopping|chop]] the onion. Heat the oil in a [[Cookbook:Saucepan|saucepan]], and add the onion and garlic.\n# Combine bouillon, sugar, sherry and tomato mash, and add this mixture to the saucepan.\n# Keep stirring and leave to [[Cookbook:Boiling|boil]] for 5 minutes.\n\n[[Category:Recipes]]\n[[Category:Indonesian recipes]]\n[[Category:Recipes with metric units]]\n[[Category:Recipes for sauces and condiments]]\n[[Category:Recipes using sugar]]\n[[Category:Recipes using garlic]]\n[[Category:Recipes using chicken broth and stock]]","isRecipe":true,"recipe":{"name":"Babi Panggang Sauce","nameAr":null,"servings":null,"servingsSourceText":"4","ingredients":[{"id":"source-line-1","name":"1 small onion","sourceText":"1 small onion","amountText":"1 small onion","amount":null,"unit":null,"foodBinding":null},{"id":"source-line-2","name":"1 clove of garlic","sourceText":"1 clove of garlic","amountText":"1 clove of garlic","amount":null,"unit":null,"foodBinding":null},{"id":"source-line-3","name":"1 tablespoon of oil","sourceText":"1 tablespoon of oil","amountText":"1 tablespoon of oil","amount":null,"unit":null,"foodBinding":null},{"id":"source-line-4","name":"1.5 deciliter (150 ml) of chicken broth","sourceText":"1.5 deciliter (150 ml) of chicken broth","amountText":"1.5 deciliter (150 ml) of chicken broth","amount":null,"unit":null,"foodBinding":null},{"id":"source-line-5","name":"2 tablespoons of sugar","sourceText":"2 tablespoons of sugar","amountText":"2 tablespoons of sugar","amount":null,"unit":null,"foodBinding":null},{"id":"source-line-6","name":"1 tablespoon of sherry","sourceText":"1 tablespoon of sherry","amountText":"1 tablespoon of sherry","amount":null,"u